name: assistant-analytics
description: ask Claude for Salesmessage response-time and credit-usage breakdowns
target: claude-ai
# Intro / outro title cards, rendered by cards.mjs after compose.
# Format: "Headline | Subhead" - both appear on the card and are read aloud.
# Logo, colours and fonts always come from productvideos/brand.
intro: Salesmessage MCP Server | A demo of live analytics, asked in plain English
outro: Thanks for watching | Do you have any questions? Follow up with us any time - we are happy to help
Steps:
Open a chat with Claude connected to the Salesmsg MCP server
Ask the assistant: "How many new contacts did we get last month, and how does that compare to the month before?"
Confirm the assistant returns a contact count for the period plus a trend versus the previous period
Ask the assistant: "How many conversations did we have this week compared to last week?"
Confirm the assistant returns conversation volume plus a trend versus the previous period
Ask the assistant: "How many calls did we make and receive last week, and what's our average call duration?"
Confirm the assistant returns call volume and average inbound/outbound duration in a human-readable unit (minutes/seconds, not a raw multiplier)
Ask the assistant: "How many messages did we send and receive last month, and what's our delivery rate?"
Confirm the assistant returns message volume and a delivery rate
Ask the assistant: "How's the team doing on response times this month versus last month?"
Confirm the assistant returns team-level response-time metrics plus a trend versus the previous period
Ask the assistant: "Can you break that down by agent?"
Confirm the assistant returns a per-agent leaderboard of response times
Ask the assistant: "How many credits did we use this month, broken down by type?"
Confirm the assistant returns total credit usage with a category breakdown
Ask the assistant: "Break that down further by source, like broadcasts, automations, and chatbot"
Confirm the assistant returns an itemized credit breakdown by source that sums to the same total as step 15